          "text": "HAN Lin 韓霖 (T. 雨公, H. 寓菴), scholar and official, was a native of Chiang-chou, Shansi, and a sixth generation descendant of Han Chung 韓重 (T. 淳夫, H. 拙齋, chin-shih of 1478), who rose to be president of the Board of Works.",
